Package: amba-virt-server
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Ambarella hardware-accelerator virtualization server
 amba-virt-server runs in EVE Dom0. It loads the accelerator kernel
 modules, brokers the accelerator and camera for HVM guests, and
 serves their client sessions.
